      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "SUPPLEMENT:\nWhen DynamicBone is automatically converted to PhysBone, the disabled DynamicBone Component (GameObject is enabled at this time) is also enabled.\nSince there are many cases where bones are enabled and only the DynamicBone Component attached to the bone is disabled, it is necessary to ignore the disabled DynamicBone Component when performing the automatic conversion.\n(I think there are many cases where DynamicBone Component is enabled/disabled in ExMenu, etc. in the same way, but I think it is difficult for auto-conversion to support this, but I don't know)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
