      "value": "@{5b83e4ecbf31801631aa98b6|full_name}: For avatars that are already uploaded I don't imagine there's much the autoconvert can to make it work with animations\nBut for ones your converting in Unity it could simply look through the animation file for references to the Dynamic Bone script and replace it with the Phys Bones script (Simplifying it'd be slighty different)",
