      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can attest this happened to me, and can contribute live instances of it. \nI have some breast dynamic bones on my avatar prefab I simply disable for clipping issues, but always keep since I copy and paste the settings to other avatars as a template and may need to use them as part of the base. The change that every component loses the disabled setting on the change is pretty disruptive, though something easy to prevent going forward.",
