      "value": "Hey, not sure how much of a bug this is but:\nThe issue lies in the animation clips not being converted and thus referencing a missing script (DB) when trying to turn something on/off. You'll have to manually adjust it for now.\nBUT even if you have a DB set to disabled, the automatic conversion (ingame at least) will make it enabled either way.",
